  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Game Created as Coursework for UIC as part of CS426 Videogame Design\n\nLevel
    designer: Rafael Maatouk \nGame Mechanics Designer: Fernando Lopez\nUI/UX & Player
    Designer: Andrew Yoe\nVoice Actors: Rafael Maatouk, Fernando Lopez\n\nAssets
    Used\nInteractive Buttons by Toinou Prod\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/tools/interactive-buttons-292066
    \r\n\r\nFootsteps - Essentials by Nox_Sound\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/audio/sound-fx/foley/footsteps-essentials-189879
    \r\n\r\nSci-Fi Lab Kit \u2013 Modular Stylized Low Poly Environment Assets by
    Hani Jahan Design\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/sci-fi/sci-fi-lab-kit-modular-stylized-low-poly-environment-assets-324212
    \r\n\r\n3D Defence Lazer Turret by Kostyantyn Grygoryev\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/sci-fi/3d-defence-lazer-turret-190350
    \r\n\r\nSciFi Simple Gun Turret Set by Tarko 3D\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/scifi-simple-gun-turret-set-62750 
    \r\n\r\n3D Sprite Sci-Fi props by Oiva Kahri\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/3d-sprite-sci-fi-props-246349
    \r\n\r\nSci Fi Doors by MASH Virtual\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/sci-fi/sci-fi-doors-162876
    \r\n\r\nFree LowPoly SciFi by Cuboom\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/sci-fi/free-lowpoly-scifi-110070
    \n\nMusic:\nDerelict Spaceship Mix // Dark Space Ambient\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s4r2HyVSV2o\n\nTornado
    Siren Sound effect\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VOSTEarWrqQ  "
